'. That text is now contradicted by the scoped force and by the existing refs/changes/* replication.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f7abf461088a9bcd4","impact":0.55,"is_primary":null,"location":"Plan section 'Plan' — third bullet (docs/ADR consumers); docs/adr/0010-gerrit-github-replication.md lines 96-104","norm_id":"n7c7d269853e57700","priority":0.3438,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A future reader consults ADR-0010, sees 'never refs/changes/*' and 'NON-force refspecs', and believes the live config is non-force for change refs — contradicting the deployed forced spec","A subsequent replication-config change re-derives safety invariants from ADR-0010's stale text"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Extend the third Plan bullet to also amend docs/adr/0010-gerrit-github-replication.md (line 103 'never refs/changes/*' and the line 96 non-force framing) with a note pointing to the ADR-0021 scoped-force amendment, so the ADR-0010 contract text stays consistent with the deployed config.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.625,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"no","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"module","debt_impact":"medium","divergent_implementation":"incomplete_enumeration","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"medium","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"silent","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"bl